/while-do

/X = 1
/while (X < 10) do
/   X = X + 1
/Endwhile
Loop,       Load X
            Subt Ten
            SkipCond 000    /如果小于零，就跳过退出程序，去加一
            Halt
            Jump AddOne


AddOne,     Load X
            Add One
            Store X
            Output
            Jump Loop

X,          dec 1
One,        dec 1
Ten,        dec 10